    "Name": "Parakeet PRK-2C",
    "Details": "The PRK-2C is the garrison variant of the Parakeet, trading the stealth and spotting suite of the PRK-10 for direct combat capability. The Guardian ECM and CLPS were removed, only the Active Probe remains. The ER Medium Laser is retained while a head-mounted Micro Pulse Laser adds anti-infantry coverage. An SRM 4 in the left torso carries fifty rounds with ammo bins typically loaded with tear gas or smoke for support work.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Advanced Optics</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.99</color></b>",
